```json
{
  "Logging": {
    "LogLevel": {
      "Default": "Information",
      "Microsoft.AspNetCore": "Warning"
    }
  },
  "AllowedHosts": "*",
  "Jwt": {
    "Key": "your-secret-key-here-must-be-at-least-256-bits",
    "Issuer": "ApiGateway",
    "Audience": "ApiGatewayUsers"
  },
  "Serilog": {
    "MinimumLevel": {
      "Default": "Information",
      "Override": {
        "Microsoft": "Warning",
        "System": "Warning"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

The above code modifications and additions implement Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and ensure that proper role claims extraction and enforcement are in place. Role-specific policies have been defined to manage access based on user roles. Additionally, tests have been added to verify the functionality of token generation and validation processes ensuring security compliance.